---
// src/components/WorkExperience.astro
---

<div class="experienceCard">
  <div class="card-header">
    <div class="role-info">
      <h3 class="role">Backend Developer</h3>
      <span class="company">Stealth Startup</span>
    </div>

    <div class="meta-details">
      <span class="meta-item date">
        <!-- Calendar Icon -->
        <svg class="icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2" ry="2"/>
          <line x1="16" x2="16" y1="2" y2="6"/>
          <line x1="8" x2="8" y1="2" y2="6"/>
          <line x1="3" x2="21" y1="10" y2="10"/>
        </svg>
        Jan 2026 – Present
      </span>
      <span class="meta-item location">
        <!-- MapPin Icon -->
        <svg class="icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
        </svg>
        Delhi, India
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul class="highlights">
    <li>
      Architecting and scaling backend services built with <span class="badge">Python</span> and <span class="badge">Django</span>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Designing optimized database schemas and high-throughput RESTful endpoints with cursor/offset pagination.
    </li>
    <li>
      Built an in-house <span class="accent-text">Service Manager</span> to automate Docker container lifecycle management and orchestration.
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>

<style>
  .experienceCard {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30, 20, 45, 0.65), rgba(15, 15, 20, 0.85));
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
    border-radius: 24px;
    color: var(--text);
    height: 100%;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .experienceCard:hover {
    border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .role-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .role {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .company {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #c084fc;
  }

  .meta-details {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  }

  .icon {
    width: 0.9rem;
    height: 0.9rem;
    color: #c084fc;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .highlights {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .highlights li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .highlights li::marker {
    color: #c084fc;
  }

  .badge {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    background: rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.12);
    color: #c084fc;
    border: 1px solid rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.3);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .accent-text {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>